   "context": "",
   "is_format": false,
   "locations": [
    "scams/templates/scams/report_form.html:139"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "ScamDB generates reports on the latest scams to help other individuals and organizations.",
   "context": "",
   "is_format": false,
   "locations": [
    "scams/templates/scams/report_form.html:140"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Your details stay private.",
   "context": "",
   "is_format": false,
   "locations": [
    "scams/templates/scams/report_form.html:143"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Your name, email and phone number are never shown on public pages.",
   "context": "",
   "is_format": false,
   "locations": [
    "scams/templates/scams/report_form.html:144"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "If you have been scammed",
   "context": "",
   "is_format": false,
   "locations": [
    "scams/templates/scams/report_form.html:151"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Stop replying to the scammer and do not send any more money.",
   "context": "",
   "is_format": false,
   "locations": [
    "scams/templates/scams/report_form.html:154"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "If you paid or shared card details, call your bank or card provider straight away.",
   "context": "",
   "is_format": false,
   "locations": [
    "scams/templates/scams/report_form.html:155"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Change any passwords you shared and turn on two-step verification.",
   "context": "",
   "is_format": false,
   "locations": [
    "scams/templates/scams/report_form.html:156"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Keep screenshots, messages and receipts as evidence.",
   "context": "",
   "is_format": false,
   "locations": [
    "scams/templates/scams/report_form.html:157"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "This form does not alert the police or your bank. Report it to them as well.",
   "context": "",
   "is_format": false,
   "locations": [
    "scams/templates/scams/report_form.html:158"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "How to spot and report scams",
   "context": "",
   "is_format": false,
   "locations": [
    "scams/templates/scams/report_form.html:160"
   ]
  },
  {
