   "context": "",
   "is_format": false,
   "locations": [
    "scams/templates/scams/report_form.html:172"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Your name, email and phone number are kept with your report. They are never shown on the dashboard or in the list of reports.",
   "context": "",
   "is_format": true,
   "locations": [
    "scams/templates/scams/report_form.html:174"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "<a href=\"%(privacy_url)s\">Read our privacy policy</a>.",
   "context": "",
   "is_format": true,
   "locations": [
    "scams/templates/scams/report_form.html:175"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Stay Informed About Digital Scams",
   "context": "",
   "is_format": false,
   "locations": [
    "scams/templates/scams/scam_awareness_page.html:4"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Learn the warning signs of common scams affecting immigrants and families, the steps to take if you are targeted, and where to report a scam.",
   "context": "",
   "is_format": false,
   "locations": [
    "scams/templates/scams/scam_awareness_page.html:5"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Topics reviewed:",
   "context": "",
   "is_format": false,
   "locations": [
    "scams/templates/scams/scam_awareness_page.html:13"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Thank you for your report",
   "context": "",
   "is_format": false,
   "locations": [
    "scams/templates/scams/scam_awareness_page.html:23"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Read through the topics below to",
   "context": "",
   "is_format": false,
   "locations": [
    "scams/templates/scams/scam_awareness_page.html:26"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Stay Informed &amp; Protect Yourself<br>From Future Scams",
   "context": "",
   "is_format": true,
   "locations": [
    "scams/templates/scams/scam_awareness_page.html:27"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Scams keep changing, but the warning signs don't. Spend a few minutes here so you can spot trouble before it reaches your wallet.",
   "context": "",
   "is_format": true,
   "locations": [
    "scams/templates/scams/scam_awareness_page.html:28"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Common Scams Affecting Immigrants and Families",
   "context": "",
   "is_format": false,
   "locations": [
    "scams/templates/scams/scam_awareness_page.html:48"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Tap each example to see what it looks like in real life.",
   "context": "",
   "is_format": false,
   "locations": [
    "scams/templates/scams/scam_awareness_page.html:49"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Fake job &amp; \"easy money\" offers",
   "context": "",
   "is_format": true,
   "locations": [
    "scams/templates/scams/scam_awareness_page.html:57"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Reviewed",
   "context": "awareness topic badge",
   "is_format": false,
   "locations": [
    "scams/templates/scams/scam_awareness_page.html:59",
    "scams/templates/scams/scam_awareness_page.html:78",
    "scams/templates/scams/scam_awareness_page.html:98",
    "scams/templates/scams/scam_awareness_page.html:117"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Someone offers a job with great pay for very little work, often by text or social media. Before you start, they ask you to pay for training or equipment, or to deposit a check and send part of it back. A real employer never asks you to pay them before you start working.",
   "context": "",
   "is_format": true,
   "locations": [
    "scams/templates/scams/scam_awareness_page.html:67"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Scam messages claiming to be from immigration or government agencies",
   "context": "",
   "is_format": false,
   "locations": [
    "scams/templates/scams/scam_awareness_page.html:77"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "You get a call, text, or letter claiming to be from immigration, the IRS, or another agency. It says you owe a fee or risk losing your status unless you pay right away, often by gift card or wire transfer. Government agencies contact you by official mail first, and they never demand gift cards.",
   "context": "",
   "is_format": true,
   "locations": [
    "scams/templates/scams/scam_awareness_page.html:87"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Calls or texts impersonating banks, utilities, or tech support",
   "context": "",
   "is_format": false,
   "locations": [
    "scams/templates/scams/scam_awareness_page.html:97"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "You receive calls, texts, or voicemails from someone claiming to be from a bank, insurance company, utility provider, or tech support team. They may say you applied for a loan, have an account problem, or have a security issue. They pressure you to confirm personal information, banking details, or payment information immediately. Legitimate companies never ask for sensitive information through unsolicited calls or texts.",
   "context": "",
   "is_format": true,
   "locations": [
    "scams/templates/scams/scam_awareness_page.html:106"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Marketplace &amp; payment scams",
   "context": "",
   "is_format": true,
   "locations": [
    "scams/templates/scams/scam_awareness_page.html:116"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "You're buying or selling something online — a car, an apartment, or furniture. The other person pushes you to pay outside the platform, asks for a deposit before you see it in person, or sends a check for more than the price and asks you to refund the difference. Never pay for something you haven't seen in person.",
   "context": "",
   "is_format": true,
   "locations": [
    "scams/templates/scams/scam_awareness_page.html:126"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Warning Signs",
   "context": "",
   "is_format": false,
   "locations": [
    "scams/templates/scams/scam_awareness_page.html:141"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Check off anything that sounds familiar.",
   "context": "",
   "is_format": false,
   "locations": [
    "scams/templates/scams/scam_awareness_page.html:143"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Someone says you must act right away or threatens you if you do not.",
   "context": "",
   "is_format": false,
   "locations": [
    "scams/templates/scams/scam_awareness_page.html:150"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "They ask for gift cards, wire transfers, cash, or payments through apps.",
   "context": "",
   "is_format": false,
   "locations": [
    "scams/templates/scams/scam_awareness_page.html:156"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "They contact you out of nowhere by phone, text, email, or social media.",
   "context": "",
   "is_format": false,
   "locations": [
    "scams/templates/scams/scam_awareness_page.html:162"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "They ask for your personal information, Social Security number, bank details, or immigration documents.",
   "context": "",
   "is_format": false,
   "locations": [
    "scams/templates/scams/scam_awareness_page.html:168"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Clear checklist",
   "context": "",
   "is_format": false,
   "locations": [
    "scams/templates/scams/scam_awareness_page.html:173"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Clear Steps to Take When Faced with a Scam",
   "context": "",
   "is_format": false,
   "locations": [
    "scams/templates/scams/scam_awareness_page.html:182"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "<strong>Stop.</strong> Do not send money or provide any personal information.",
   "context": "",
   "is_format": true,
   "locations": [
    "scams/templates/scams/scam_awareness_page.html:186"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "<strong>Verify independently.</strong> Call the company or agency yourself, using a number from their official website — not the one the caller gave you.",
   "context": "",
   "is_format": true,
   "locations": [
    "scams/templates/scams/scam_awareness_page.html:189"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "<strong>Talk to someone you trust.</strong> Before you act, speak with a family member, friend, or community organization.",
   "context": "",
   "is_format": true,
   "locations": [
    "scams/templates/scams/scam_awareness_page.html:192"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "<strong>Report it.</strong> Report possible scams using our report page and the resources below so others can be warned too.",
   "context": "",
   "is_format": true,
   "locations": [
    "scams/templates/scams/scam_awareness_page.html:195"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Trusted External Resources",
   "context": "",
   "is_format": false,
   "locations": [
    "scams/templates/scams/scam_awareness_page.html:207"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Use these resources for reporting and support.",
   "context": "",
   "is_format": false,
   "locations": [
    "scams/templates/scams/scam_awareness_page.html:208"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "(opens in a new tab)",
   "context": "",
   "is_format": false,
   "locations": [
    "scams/templates/scams/scam_awareness_page.html:215"
   ]
